3833488.steps:
1.Login using IDP saml user, check default session time;
2.Change the default session time on IDP, different IDPs may configure at different fields, for example, OKTA, it's "maximum app session time", change it to 30 minutes, for onelogin, it's "SAML SessionNotOnOrAfter", change it to 45minutes
3.Logout and relogin using saml user, check the session time.
